WEBVTT

00:07:59.016 --> 00:08:03.312
525 600 tampones.

00:08:03.354 --> 00:08:04.522
Lo siento mucho.

00:08:04.522 --> 00:08:09.735
525 000 tampones

00:08:09.777 --> 00:08:15.950
en el espacio.

00:08:16.742 --> 00:08:17.910
Gracias a todos.

00:08:17.952 --> 00:08:22.831
(Aplausos)

00:08:22.873 --> 00:08:24.708
Muchas gracias. Gracias.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.627
(Aplausos)

00:08:26.627 --> 00:08:28.379
Gracias, en verdad lo aprecio.

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:30.631
Entonces...